'' A SHARED POINTER INITIALISED WITH A NONZERO CONSTANT ADDRESS -- 'cptr( any ptr, 15 )' -- is an inttoptr constant (fbc's dim/global-init.bas); tiko wrote 'ptr 15' and clang refused the module. Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/ptr-global-int-init.bas -o tests/codegen/ptrglobalintinit.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/ptrglobalintinit.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: -1             -1
